historytracers (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split into three binary packages:
    - historytracers (main): binary, service, www/ (excluding images/)
    - historytracers-images: all image files from www/images/
    - historytracers-devel: source tree excluding generated and
      packaging content (www/, build/, packaging/, debian/, .git/)

